WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Forward heavy kick starts the confirm.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.500
Jamie spends two Super stocks to activate Level 2.

3
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Standing heavy kick continues the activation route.

4
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.650
Standing medium punch connects during the first cancel Rush.

5
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.250
Crouching heavy punch links into the second cancel.

6
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.950
The second Rush standing medium connects as Drive empties.

7
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.650
Crouching heavy punch continues while Jamie is in burnout.

8
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.350
Heavy Palm starts the final special sequence.

9
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.300
The full-stock Palm follow-up finishes the juggle.
